    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="0bd7fd2d-f9e5-5217-95a0-6dca4217cf8b" activityNameId="968dfd7e-870c-57a4-9c86-37f3444d17f5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Overflow element, steel, approx. 40 m3/h</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Overflow element, steel, approx. 40 m3/h
Production of a typical component used for a ventilation system in a multi family house. The house considered in the investigation includes 6 flats with 130 m2 floor area each and a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h.;
UUID: b27409a2-aabd-3017-8b32-89436445a9b3
Materials used for the production. Estimation of electricity use for the different production steps. Energy use for heating of the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for the Infrastructure of the Production site included.
Location: Data for production in Germany used.
Technology: Design air flow 40 m2/h per element. Element made of galvanised steel insulated with rubber. Installation e.g. above door separating the rooms- Weight per element 1.1 kg
Time period: Materials investigated in 2003
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and technical information of producer. Data of one common product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b27409a2-aabd-3017-8b32-89436445a9b3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
